stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> Boot
    Boot --> AuthHandshake: initialize BFF auth handshake
    AuthHandshake --> LoginScreen: user not authenticated
    AuthHandshake --> AppShell: user authenticated
    LoginScreen --> OAuthChallenge: Microsoft sign-in
    LoginScreen --> GuestSession: Dev/Test guest flow
    OAuthChallenge --> AppShell: cookie established
    GuestSession --> AppShell: cookie established
    AppShell --> RouteGuard: AuthorizeRouteView gate
    RouteGuard --> ProtectedPage: authorized
    RouteGuard --> AccessDenied: not authorized
    ProtectedPage --> AppShell: navigation or refresh
    AccessDenied --> LoginScreen: requires sign-in
    AppShell --> [*]
